{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#card-zh","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Myosotis 是一款为 DSH 提供持久记忆与全文知识库的插件。它把记忆和检索结果作为提示词段落注入，并注册模型可调用的维护工具。主要功能包括按全局、项目、会话和深记忆保存结论，按当前话题检索记忆，自动捕获明确的记忆指令，以及将本地文档切块后用 SQLite 全文索引并按文件和行号返回摘录。适合希望跨会话保留偏好、项目约定并查找项目文档的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key；深记忆与知识库需要支持 node:sqlite 的运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-123","lib/tools.js:42-46","lib/kb-tools.js:39-43","lib/kb-service.js:51-68"]}
{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#card-en","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH-Myosotis adds persistent memory and a document library to DSH. It injects relevant memories and offers tools to save, search, and remove them in four scopes. It indexes local documents and returns cited excerpts. No API key is needed; deep features require node:sqlite.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:71-123","lib/tools.js:42-46","lib/kb-tools.js:39-43","lib/kb-service.js:51-68"]}
