{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#feature-1","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Myosotis 的功能「四层持久记忆」：模型可保存、搜索和删除全局、项目、会话及深记忆中的条目。调用 memory_save、memory_search 或 memory_forget 来管理记忆。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:33-46","lib/tools.js:126-130","lib/tools.js:193-196"]}
{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#feature-2","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Myosotis 的功能「本地文档入库与检索」：将文件或目录加入知识库并按关键词搜索内容。调用 kb_add 入库、kb_search 查询，结果包含文件、标题路径和行号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/kb-tools.js:39-52","lib/kb-tools.js:131-135"]}
{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#feature-3","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Myosotis 的功能「按话题注入回忆」：请求组装时从记忆服务生成背景段落，并可在启用知识库注入后添加检索摘录。段落分别受记忆和知识库配置控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:83-114"]}
{"unit_id":"KurohaneKaoruko__DSH-Myosotis#feature-4","repo":"KurohaneKaoruko/DSH-Myosotis","commit":"3fd981970b6f29b01b49e51c937b535167edbb68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Myosotis 的功能「学习反馈与记忆复盘」：入站消息会关联上一轮注入的记忆以记录反馈，memory_review 可列出被纠正、过时、重复或矛盾的条目，供模型进一步处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:128-146","lib/tools.js:282-298"]}
